# Java / Spring / Maven

Read before writing or changing Java, Spring, or Maven files — do not rely on memory:

- `java-standards`
- `clean-code`
- `hexagonal-architecture` when the work is ports, adapters, or layering

Load the project's own architecture skill instead where it has one. Project conventions beat
skill defaults.
